 "descricao": "Supremacy Collector's Edition Pour Homme by Afnan is a Chypre Fruity fragrance for men. This is a new fragrance. Supremacy Collector's Edition Pour Homme was launched in 2024. The nose behind this fragrance is Imran Fazlani. Top notes are Pineapple, Bergamot, White Flowers and Apple; middle notes are Orange Blossom, Birch and Amber; base notes are oak moss, Musk and Ambergris.\nSupremacy Collector's Edition, a captivating fragrance that honors the legacy of our beloved Supremacy collection. This exquisite scent combines the classic allure of a timeless classic with a refreshing twist of white floral and amber notes.",
